<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela foreign reserves rise to $15.428 bln.</title>
<headline>Venezuela foreign reserves rise to $15.428 bln.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's total foreign reserves rose $145 million, or 0.9 percent, in the week to January 27 to $15.428 billion, according to new figures released by the central bank.</p>
<p>Reserves were up from $15.283 billion on January 20, the bank's latest weekly bulletin of indicators showed.</p>
</text>
